# OS / IDE noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
.claude
.agents
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# VS Code: ignore only machine-local files, keep shared ones (extensions.json,
# tasks.json) trackable.
**/.vscode/.browse.c_cpp.db*
**/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
**/.vscode/ipch/
**/.vscode/launch.json
**/.vscode/mcp.json
**/.vscode/settings.json

# PlatformIO build artifacts
**/.pio/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.data/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
*.egg-info/

# Secrets — never commit these. Deliberately NOT path-anchored: the tree has
# been re-laid-out once already, and an editor backup (secrets.h.orig) or an
# older branch checkout would otherwise put a filled-in secrets file on a
# committable path. The `!` lines re-admit the tracked templates.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.h
secrets.h.*
!secrets.h.example
